  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-30T00:26:27.701Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "While in game, it will hitch for every avatar you have to load or unload.\n\nAreas we noticed it happen on;\n-----\nLoading into a new world and as a large group is was pretty bad as the game would hitch for every player. The first one that enters has it the worst.\n\nWhen someone switching a avatar you will see the steamvr vrchat logo for a second.\n\nNew player joining the world.\n\nLeaving the world (any means) the one still in the world will hitch for a sec, for every player leaving.\n\nIt also happens on the avatar menu.\n-----\n\n\nWhile in VR it is really bad and you can't even move properly if it is a large group moving around.\nIt's very unpleasant and actually will cause nausea for some",
